      "zh-Hant": "出身與法律職涯",
      "en": "Origins and legal career"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1871年10月17日生於Csúz，在佩斯修習法律。1918年前任司法部國際法司司長，為《二十世紀》期刊的創辦人之一，1914至1918年也在東方商業學院任教。",
      "en": "Born at Csúz on 17 October 1871, he studied law in Pest. Until 1918 he headed the international-law department of the Ministry of Justice, was one of the founders of the journal Huszadik Század, and taught at the Eastern Commercial Academy in 1914–1918."
     },
