      "zh-Hant": "1896年4月24日生於普埃布拉州特齊烏特蘭，學的是會計。1914年加入革命運動，後來任戰爭與海軍部的總務長，之後為副部長，1937年12月27日被任命為戰爭與海軍部長。",
      "en": "Born at Teziutlán, Puebla, on 24 April 1896, he qualified as an accountant. He joined the revolutionary movement in 1914, became chief administrative officer and then undersecretary of the Ministry of War and Navy, and on 27 December 1937 was appointed its secretary."
